@startuml
title E Visa Processing and Follow-Up System State Diagram

[*] --> Initial

state Initial
state NotLoggedIn
state LoggedIn
state ApplicationSubmitted
state ApplicationProcessing
state ApplicationApproved
state ApplicationRejected
state LoggedOut

Initial --> NotLoggedIn : System starts

NotLoggedIn --> Initial : System reset
NotLoggedIn --> LoggedIn : User successfully logs in

LoggedIn --> ApplicationSubmitted : Submit application after login, payment, modify details, view details, give feedback, view purpose, check status, cancel application

ApplicationSubmitted --> ApplicationProcessing : Application is processed

ApplicationProcessing --> ApplicationApproved : Application approved
ApplicationProcessing --> ApplicationRejected : Application rejected

ApplicationApproved --> LoggedIn : User logs out
ApplicationRejected --> LoggedOut : User logs out

LoggedIn --> ApplicationSubmitted : View application status
LoggedIn --> ApplicationSubmitted : Check status

LoggedIn --> ApplicationSubmitted : View details
LoggedIn --> ApplicationSubmitted : Modify details

LoggedIn --> ApplicationSubmitted : Give feedback
LoggedIn --> ApplicationSubmitted : View purpose of application

LoggedIn --> ApplicationSubmitted : Cancel application

ApplicationApproved --> [*] : System completes
ApplicationRejected --> [*] : System completes
LoggedOut --> [*] : System completes

@enduml
